 HISTORY                                                          8149 1451
 -------                                                          8149 1451
    This library was produced by the Low Energy Interaction       8149 1451
    Physics (LEIP) group at North Carolina State University, USA. 8149 1451
    The thermal scattering law data for Uranium in Uranium        8149 1451
    Carbide was developed using ab initio lattice dynamics        8149 1451
    (AILD)[1,2]. Ten temperatures are available in this library.  8149 1451
    The Full Law Analysis Scattering System Hub (FLASSH) system   8149 1451
    was used to produce File 7 MT = 2, 4 data for Uranium in UC   8149 1451
    [3]. MAT=8149 and ZA=8249 are used for U in UC (HEU-93%       8149 1451
    enriched). Elemental AWR and cross sections were computed     8149 1451
    from ENDF/B-VIII.0 MF=3 MT=2 nuclide evaluations [4] at 1e-5eV8149 1451
    with C-12 updated to reflect a mass of exactly 12 amu.        8149 1451
